💡 TCS DIGITAL STRATEGIC EXTRACTIONS

1. O(1) Set Lookups: Never search arrays with if item in list: inside a loop. Convert to a set first to avoid Time Limit Exceeded (TLE) errors.
2. Handle Dynamic IO: Practice reading dynamic multi-line inputs using sys.stdin.read().splitlines() to avoid compiler crashes.
